  "prefLabel": "Sphc 102.07 Hearing aid dealer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 102.07 \"Hearing aid dealer\" means “hearing aid dealer” as defined in RSA 326-F:1, V, namely, “any person engaged in the testing of human hearing for the purpose of selecting, fitting, or otherwise dealing in hearing aids.”\n\nSource. #14193, eff 2-12-25",
